	<div class="d-flex flex-column details-wrapper">
		<div class="programme-image">
			<img src="https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/ICI/12545316.jpeg" alt="Pressure" class="image border"/>
		</div>
		<div class="synopsis">
			<div class="films-single__syn-featured"><p><span style="font-weight: bold;">Brendan Fraser and Andrew Scott are as fierce as the storms in this deeply emotional film about one of the most critical decisions made during World War II.</span></p><p><span style="font-weight: bold;"><br></span></p></div><div class="films-single__syn"><p>In the tense 72 hours before D-Day, General Dwight D. Eisenhower and Captain James Stagg face an impossible choice–launch the most dangerous seaborne invasion in history or risk losing the war altogether.</p></div>
		</div>
	</div>
