</div><div class="programme d-flex">
	<div class="d-flex flex-column details-wrapper">
		<div class="programme-image">
			<img src="https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/ICI/12511578.jpeg" alt="Dracula (1958) | 4K Restoration" class="image border"/>
		</div>
		<div class="synopsis">
			<p><strong>Hammer Films resurrects&nbsp;<em>Dracula</em>&nbsp;in a landmark new 4K restoration, featuring long-lost footage unseen for over 60 years.</strong></p><p><strong><br></strong></p><p>A Gothic horror landmark that introduced the world to Christopher Lee’s definitive Count, terrifying, seductive and unforgettable opposite Peter Cushing’s fearless Van Helsing.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>The cut the censors tried to bury.</strong>&nbsp;This landmark 4K restoration reinstates footage thought lost for over 60 years, previously seen only in Japan in 1958 and never released in the UK or US.</p>
		</div>
	</div>
