		<div class="synopsis">
			<p data-pm-slice="1 1 []"><span style="font-weight: bold;">A spectacularly restored concert film capturing George Michael at the height of his creative power during his record-breaking Faith Tour.</span></p><p><br></p><p>Paired with a rare and intimate glimpse into the era that defined him. Featuring unseen 35mm footage and a new short film by Mary McCartney, drawing on newly discovered audio and imagery from the Faith era, it offers a vivid insight into George’s world at a defining moment in his life and career.</p>
