</div><div class="programme d-flex">
	<div class="d-flex flex-column details-wrapper">
		<div class="programme-image">
			<img src="https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/ICI/12272349.jpeg" alt="GIANT – The Play" class="image border"/>
		</div>
		<div class="synopsis">
			<span style="font-weight: bold;">Giant is a 2024 play written by Mark Rosenblatt. It premiered at the Royal Court Theatre in 2024 in a production starring John Lithgow as Roald Dahl and won three Laurence Olivier Awards, including Best New Play.</span><div><br></div><div>-</div><div><br></div><div><div class="films-single__syn-featured"><p>The five-star, critically acclaimed Olivier Award-winning play starring John Lithgow, comes to the big screen in a filmed live production from London’s West End, captured ahead of its sold-out Broadway run.</p><p><br></p></div><div class="films-single__syn"><p>Set over a single afternoon in 1983, GIANT follows Roald Dahl as he faces the fallout from his explicitly antisemitic remarks while preparing to publish The Witches. Inspired by real events, this acclaimed play is a gripping, darkly humorous portrait of fame, accountability and the power of words.</p></div></div>
		</div>
	</div>
	<div class="d-flex flex-column performance-list-wrapper">		
		<h2 class="title"><a href="https://book.ilkleycinema.co.uk/IlkleyCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_1030.TcsWebTab_1031.TcsProgramme_12263128">GIANT – The Play</a> / <span class="highlight">SHOWTIMES</span></h2>	
		<div class="performance-list">
			<table cellpadding="0"><tr valign="top"><td><table cellpadding="0"><tr><td class="PeformanceListDate">Thursday 19 Nov 2026</td><td width="10px"></td><td class="PeformanceListTimes"><span class="StartTimeAndStatus"><a class="Button" href="https://book.ilkleycinema.co.uk/IlkleyCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_1030.TcsWebTab_1031.TcsPerformance_12263666.TcsSection_523880" title="Click to Book">19:15</a></span></td></tr><tr><td class="PeformanceListDate">Sunday 22 Nov 2026</td><td width="10px"></td><td class="PeformanceListTimes"><span class="StartTimeAndStatus"><a class="Button" href="https://book.ilkleycinema.co.uk/IlkleyCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_1030.TcsWebTab_1031.TcsPerformance_12263668.TcsSection_523880" title="Click to Book">13:45</a></span></td></tr><tr><td class="PeformanceListDate">Tuesday 24 Nov 2026</td><td width="10px"></td><td class="PeformanceListTimes"><span class="StartTimeAndStatus"><a class="Button" href="https://book.ilkleycinema.co.uk/IlkleyCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_1030.TcsWebTab_1031.TcsPerformance_12263670.TcsSection_523880" title="Click to Book">19:15</a></span></td></tr><tr><td class="PeformanceListDate">Saturday 28 Nov 2026</td><td width="10px"></td><td class="PeformanceListTimes"><span class="StartTimeAndStatus"><a class="Button" href="https://book.ilkleycinema.co.uk/IlkleyCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_1030.TcsWebTab_1031.TcsPerformance_12263675.TcsSection_523880" title="Click to Book">16:00</a></span></td></tr></table></td></tr></table>
