	<div class="d-flex flex-column details-wrapper">
		<div class="programme-image">
			<img src="https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/ICI/12511799.jpeg" alt="Kendal Mountain Festival Cinematic Tour 2027" class="image border"/>
		</div>
		<div class="synopsis">
			<table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" class="t1"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" class="td1"><p class="p1">Kendal Mountain Events returns for another season of adventure and human connection.</p><p class="p2">&nbsp;</p><p class="p1">The annual Kendal Mountain Tour brings the spirit of the world-famous festival of adventure, outdoor culture, and storytelling to stages across the country. Get ready to be transported by a handpicked curation of award-winning short films, showcasing breathtaking landscapes, bold expeditions, and unforgettable stories from around the world, with some behind the scenes information from the filmmakers themselves.</p><p class="p2">&nbsp;</p><p class="p1"><b>About Kendal Mountain Festival:</b><b></b></p><p class="p1">Established in 1980, Kendal Mountain Festival celebrates all aspects of outdoor and adventure culture. An internationally-acclaimed gathering for filmmakers, writers, adventurers, and enthusiasts, the Festival showcases films, talks, exhibitions, and activities that inspire a love for the outdoors. Kendal Mountain is a global platform for sharing stories of nature, exploration, adventure, and discovery. During the four-day Festival, held annually in November, over 200 live sessions – including 300+ speakers, 150+ films, and 60+ activities – engage over 25,000 adventure-seekers and outdoor enthusiasts.</p></td></tr></tbody></table>
		</div>
	</div>
